+# RM65-B MEM integration / 短期视频记忆接入
+
+The optional MEM path retains SDK24, three native RGB views, H16/K_exec1 and
+15×4ms controls. The original rm65b_local.yaml and native SFT entry remain
+available. No dependencies or original weights were replaced.
+
+默认视频配置为三相机各四帧、stride8控制步、覆盖1.44秒。SigLIP采用共享参数的时空分离attention，在第24层后保留当前融合token；视觉输出768token。历史状态沿原归一化和32维padding，再投影为3个历史token。该实现是MEM论文机制的π0.5工程适配，不宣称官方代码逐算子复现。
+
+## Independent configurations
+
+| Config | Trainable modules | Objectives |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| configs/rm65b_mem_protocol.yaml | Final-language-layer q/o LoRA | READ/WRITE/SUBTASK CE |
+| configs/rm65b_mem_video.yaml | Visual LoRA, state projection, language LoRA | High CE, FAST CE, original-skill KV anchor |
+| configs/rm65b_mem_joint.yaml | Above plus action-expert LoRA | Above plus insulated FM |
+
+All original base parameters stay frozen in these stages. Adapter parameters and
+the history-state projection stay FP32, including checkpoint restoration. Base
+computations retain the existing mixed precision. FM stops at the prefix K/V;
+high/FAST objectives can update the visual frontend.
+
+## Status / 验证范围
+
+- 137 RLinf CPU cases and 38 RoboTwin CPU cases passed; one spawn/vector case
+  was deselected.
+- Actual SAPIEN diagnostic capture: 26 SDK24 controls, 390 physics ticks,
+  27 three-camera/state observations, valid 1.44-second histories.
+- Three actual observations matched the retained original SFT entry exactly
+  under identical noise when MEM/adapters were disabled.
+- Real-weight high/FAST gradients reached visual/state/language adapters; FM
+  reached only the expert. One isolated diagnostic optimizer update changed all
+  four intended groups, compact-save/reload matched exactly, and parameters were
+  rolled back. A fresh process also reproduced the saved probe actions exactly.
+- Native microbatch1 short-label probe allocated at most about 7.12 GiB in
+  PyTorch; sampled whole-card use reached about 9.13 GiB. This is not a general
+  large-batch or long-context training budget.
+- Autonomous READ/WRITE/SUBTASK generation still failed EOS/protocol completion.
+  No task success or learning improvement is claimed.
+
+诊断场景、人工编写文本和probe_only权重仅用于接口／梯度／恢复验证，明确排除于正式训练，不是优质示范或高层SFT暖启动产物。原始失败收据保留。
+
+## Warm-start prerequisites
+
+The configuration templates intentionally contain no training data. Fill
+data.verified_high_sft_paths with independently reviewed causal JSON/JSONL labels.
+Video/joint stages also require correctly executed action demonstrations and the
+separate original-skill anchor buffer. The loader rejects held-out, diagnostic,
+excluded and future-context records.
+
+READ cannot receive full-bank content; WRITE uses its pre-write selected view;
+SUBTASK uses the resolved selected/current-write view. Strict memory operations
+require prior READ and explicit confirmation status. Audit sources are retained
+separately from actor-visible memory. Persistent video references must match the
+actual episode, owner and physics clock.
+
+For weight transfer between stages, select the previous full checkpoint and
+create a new optimizer. Resume trainer state only within the same stage and
+manifest. A compact adapter evaluation must use the saved MEM architecture and
+base checkpoint; probe_only files are excluded diagnostics.
+
+## Validation entry points
+
+The original audit.sh and cpu_tests.sh remain intact. The standard CLI accepts
+any of the new YAML files with stage audit-config without executing a model.
+Warm-start supports independent high-only labels without fake action episodes.
+
+Reusable functional probes live in verification/mem:
+
+- verify_scene_history.py: actual simulator capture using measured-state holds.
+- verify_original_baseline.py: retained original entry reference actions.
+- verify_native_mem.py: real-weight branches, gradients and rolled-back update.
+- verify_reload.py: fresh-process compact reload and four-valid-frame backward.
+
+Use fresh output directories; failures and earlier receipts must not be
+overwritten. Reports and the installation manifest are under
+reports/mem_integration_20261018. Full production training was not started.
